        "date": "2026-02-10T08:30:00Z"
      },
      "message": "Add msdcfg bit field definitions for debug and trace security controls\n\nDefine formal register diagrams and field description tables (with WARL\naccess and reset values) for the SDEDBGALW, VSEDBGALW, USEDBGALW fields\nin the debug section and SDETRCALW, VSETRCALW, USETRCALW fields in the\ntrace section. Assign concrete bit positions for previously TBD fields.\n\nResolves https://github.com/riscv-non-isa/riscv-external-debug-security/issues/146",
