  {
    "sha": "12d5f4811105e3df18bb3e162c58f1ca7bd5a735",
    "node_id": "C_kwDOKidp_doAKDEyZDVmNDgxMTEwNWUzZGYxOGJiM2UxNjJjNThmMWNhN2JkNWE3MzU",
    "commit": {
      "author": {
        "name": "joxie",
        "email": "joxie@nvidia.com",
        "date": "2026-02-11T03:25:15Z"
      },
      "committer": {
        "name": "joxie",
        "email": "joxie@nvidia.com",
        "date": "2026-02-11T03:26:00Z"
      },
      "message": "Introduce mdtcfg CSR to decouple debug/trace security from Smsdid/SMMTT\n\nReplace msdcfg with a new independent mdtcfg (Machine Debug and Trace\nConfiguration) CSR for debug and trace security control fields. This\nremoves the dependency on Smsdid/SMMTT, allowing implementations without\nsupervisor domain support to adopt debug/trace security independently.\n\n- Define mdtcfg as a dedicated M-mode CSR (address TBD) with all six\n  control fields (SDEDBGALW, VSEDBGALW, USEDBGALW, SDETRCALW,\n  VSETRCALW, USETRCALW)\n- Remove separate trace wavedrom; reference unified mdtcfg register\n- Update all extension descriptions to reference mdtcfg\n- Fix pre-existing typo: UEDBGALW -> USEDBGALW in two tables\n- Update appendix figures and text references\n\nAddresses: https://github.com/riscv-non-isa/riscv-external-debug-security/issues/142",
      "tree": {
        "sha": "a52f20aeab3a3c89b88635cfc4a4a968c39fc421",
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/riscv-non-isa/riscv-external-debug-security/git/trees/a52f20aeab3a3c89b88635cfc4a4a968c39fc421"
      },
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/riscv-non-isa/riscv-external-debug-security/git/commits/12d5f4811105e3df18bb3e162c58f1ca7bd5a735",
      "comment_count": 0,
      "verification": {
